            <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="GLO">
                <descriptionOfRestrictions xml:lang="en">Data represent global valuable composition data for capacitors. For the 2023 capacitors, it is found that technological changes for power electronics since 80s have been maintained. However, the market share is adjusted according to the recent statistics in the literature (Group, 2020): film capacitors (50%), SMD/ceramic capacitors (30%), electrolytic (19%) with equal split for each type, and lastly tantalum capacitors (1%).</descriptionOfRestrictions>
            </locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction>
        </geography>
        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">average production of: formulation; build-up process; cutting; bisquing; Pre-Firing; Firing; Tumbling; Termination (SMT) resp. metallization; slitting; winding; metal spray; heat treatment; sawing; lead welding; epoxy filling (THT)\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of current capacitors.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
